{"asset_key":"ep8/quest_story_18260470","episode":"ep8","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18260470","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1826047001:1":{"text":"おや、もう命乞いですか？やれやれ……情けないですねぇ。","source_cn":"没想到你竟然这么快就求饶了，真是……没有骨气啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x017FECA5B1DFC9EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1826047002:1":{"text":"そうですね。ここはひとつ、ゲームをしましょう。","source_cn":"不如这样，我们来做一个游戏如何？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7D6E9143AB901C2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1826047003:1":{"text":"貴方が正解すれば、ご褒美を差し上げます。ただし、間違えたときは……罰を受けてもらいますよ。","source_cn":"如果你能答对，我就给你奖励。但要是你答错了……我也只能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3534EBCB96E690E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1826047004:1":{"text":"ご、ご褒美なんていりません、だから、どうか……どうか見逃してください！","source_cn":"我……我不要奖励！只求求……求求您放过我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB852060346B5624B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1826047005:1":{"text":"それを決めるのは、貴方ではありませんよ。","source_cn":"那可不是你说了算的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76D6538A44128D8E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1826047006:1":{"text":"貴方たちの領主様……あの忌々しい吸血鬼は、いつから姿を見せていないのです？","source_cn":"我问你，你们的领主……那个恶劣的小吸血鬼，有多久没出现了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCCB201093439D11C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1826047007:1":{"text":"わ、私は、ただの下級貴族ですから、領主様にお会いする機会など――","source_cn":"我……我只是个小贵族，根本接触不到领主阁——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x710FD38FA734DC57","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1826047008:1":{"text":"<shk>ぎゃあああっ！！</shk>","source_cn":"<shk>——啊！！！</shk>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x319478B3A62DF551","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1826047009:1":{"text":"実に心地いい悲鳴ですが……ご覧のとおり、私の寵愛を待ちわびる者は、まだ大勢いるのでね。私の時間を無駄にしないためにも、よく考えてから答えてくださいね。","source_cn":"虽然我很享受你的尖叫，但看看周围——还有这么多人在等待...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29F71A7A2F95624F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1826047010:1":{"text":"い、言います……言いますからっ！","source_cn":"我、我说……我说！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC03A0CEEEC014ECD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1826047011:1":{"text":"か、戒厳令が敷かれて、マーレ歌劇場の公演がなくなってから……領主様の姿を見ておりません……！","source_cn":"是从……从戒严以后，海歌剧院演出暂停……领主阁下就再也...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90FE351E0EF0D109","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1826047012:1":{"text":"で、ですが、三日月通りで爆発が起きたとき……通りで領主様を見かけたという人がいます。なんでも、重傷を負っていたとか……","source_cn":"不、不过，月弯街发生爆炸的时候……有人说在街上看到了她...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4DCE03962005AA3B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1826047013:1":{"text":"でも、実際に見たわけではないので、それが本当かどうかは……","source_cn":"但是……但是我不知道那是不是真的，我没有亲眼见到……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDCC8C5D48BE743A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1826047014:1":{"text":"ふむ……悪くない答えですね。よろしい。","source_cn":"嗯……这个问题你答得不错，我很满意。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50D59295D6BDA4E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1826047015:1":{"text":"さて、どんなご褒美を差し上げましょうか……","source_cn":"让我想想，该奖励你什么才好呢……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x398AD5D23E37D5EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1826047016:1":{"text":"お、お願いです……もう見逃してください……！","source_cn":"求您……求您饶了我吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x338AC6A1B0E8FE9B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1826047017:1":{"text":"見逃す？なんともつまらない提案ですねぇ。","source_cn":"饶了你？多么无趣的提议啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x290028C1E3AA222A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1826047018:1":{"text":"ああ、思いつきました。ご褒美は……もうひとつ、私の質問に答えてもらうことにしましょう。","source_cn":"啊，我想到了。你的奖励是……再回答我一个问题。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB710351A680A8A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1826047019:1":{"text":"修繕屋のムン婆という医師は、どこにいるのですか？","source_cn":"修缮屋的医师——那个穆婆婆，她去哪了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7418284EC148C2CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1826047020:1":{"text":"し、知りません！ムン婆は失踪したんです！","source_cn":"我、我不知道！她失踪了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFED6F2978B8CBCD6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1826047021:1":{"text":"バンティスによると、ムン婆が軍事要地を破壊したそうで……指名手配された彼女を捕まえるために戒厳令まで敷かれて、私たちも怖くて外に出られなくて……","source_cn":"班题斯说她破坏了军事基地，城里到处都是通缉令……军队为...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75AA43A6B011349A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1826047022:1":{"text":"もしかしたら、もう軍に捕まっているかも！そ、そうですよ……ずっと消息がないのだって、きっと捕まったからです！","source_cn":"说不定……说不定她已经被军队抓走了！对，对……她消失了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B174E38FBC9DEB9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1826047023:1":{"text":"バンティス軍に捕まった？……ふふっ。","source_cn":"被班题斯军队抓走了？呵呵……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x37904B4EA6F296DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1826047024:1":{"text":"そこまで自信満々に答えるとは、よほど罰を受けたいようですねぇ……ならば、ご期待通り――！","source_cn":"既然你这么信誓旦旦，那就别再挣扎了。乖乖受罚吧——！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3A8CCC04332B9E8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1826047025:1":{"text":"<shk>や、やめっ……！ぎゃああ！！！</shk>","source_cn":"<shk>不……不要！！啊——！</shk>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB9404357E9DB22D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:斯莱泽":{"text":"スレーザー","source":"斯莱泽","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:贵族昆廷":{"text":"貴族のクンティン","source":"贵族昆廷","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":26,"localized_text_count":25,"speaker_